    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill idle-monster capturing desktop toy in the corner of your screen. Buy upgrades, catch rare Tomomon, and customize your character at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491820/extras/d258e82ff8658204e7956b60dde3285e.avif?t=1752243123\" width=616 height=329 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the game while working</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character automatically catches the Tomomons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge Tomomon\u00a0 data to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your mons to earn money for upgrades and cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit all the biomes and try to catch all the mons to complete your journal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer your favorite Tomomons to use them on the Tomomon RPG Game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill idle-monster capturing desktop toy in the corner of your screen. Buy upgrades, catch rare Tomomon, and customize your character at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491820/extras/d258e82ff8658204e7956b60dde3285e.avif?t=1752243123\" width=616 height=329 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the game while working</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character automatically catches the Tomomons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge Tomomon\u00a0 data to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your mons to earn money for upgrades and cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit all the biomes and try to catch all the mons to complete your journal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer your favorite Tomomons to use them on the Tomomon RPG Game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
